  - .env has NO OPENROUTER_API_KEY (grep returned empty)
  - ONLY the model_combo_mappings survived because they are hardcoded UUIDs, not actual connections
  - Grok CORRECT: normal restarts do NOT wipe the DB; this was a v3.8.49 WAL corruption on unclean shutdown
  - FIX PLAN: (1) Pull OpenRouter API key from Bitwarden (ID: 6acfda8b-...); (2) Re-add as provider_connections via OmniRoute API/dashboard; (3) Upgrade to v3.8.50+ to fix WAL checkpoint root cause
